 to end in a workbench in a user project\n51\t  (the tutorial notebook opens and runs in a spawned workbench)\n52\t- Keep tutorial content maintained: record the release each tutorial is\n53\t  certified against\n54\t\n55\t## Acceptance Criteria\n56\t\n57\t- Six curated tutorials exist, one per core journey listed in the strategy\n58\t- Each tutorial is packaged with its metadata, pinned images, and validation\n59\t  manifest per the packaging format\n60\t- Each tutorial passes its validation manifest against the current platform\n61\t  release (measured by the validation tooling's pass result for every tutorial)\n62\t- Each notebook-based tutorial opens and runs to its success state in a\n63\t  workbench in a fresh user project\n64\t\n65\t## HLR Traceability\n66\t\n67\t- HLR-2 (P0) — full coverage: six curated, release-tested tutorials across the\n68\t  core journeys\n69\t- HLR-1 (P0) — contributes the curated tutorial set that the Dashboard\n70\t  tutorial gallery launches\n71\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-849adb4e23a63a73","agent_id":"a6018b7a821d5d3b3","session_id":"8fde49e5-4b3d-4b7f-9888-7a2f9f5128eb","uuid":"725b08c0-f1f0-461a-b3a5-1530295244eb","timestamp":"2026-10-26T16:32:16.531Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b8ff5ec288994209","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9019 decomposition"}
