he tutorial packaging format: browse from tutorial\n51\t  metadata, launch from pinned image references, so adding or updating a\n52\t  tutorial requires no Dashboard code change\n53\t- Scope guard: this epic delivers the gallery and launch mechanics only —\n54\t  tutorial content and its packaging format are produced elsewhere, and no\n55\t  tutorial submission/intake tooling is in scope this release\n56\t\n57\t## Acceptance Criteria\n58\t\n59\t- A user can open the tutorial gallery in the Dashboard and browse the curated\n60\t  tutorials with their metadata\n61\t- One-click launch of a notebook tutorial opens a workbench in the user's\n62\t  project with the tutorial notebook loaded and running on the tutorial's\n63\t  pinned image\n64\t- One-click launch of a pipeline tutorial imports that pipeline into the\n65\t  user's project\n66\t- A packaged tutorial can be added to or updated in the curated set with no\n67\t  Dashboard code change (verified by updating a tutorial's packaged content and\n68\t  observing the gallery pick it up)\n69\t- The end-to-end launch path is verified with a released packaged tutorial:\n70\t  launching it from the gallery produces a running workbench / imported\n71\t  pipeline in the user's project\n72\t\n73\t## HLR Traceability\n74\t\n75\t- HLR-1 (P0) — full coverage: the Dashboard tutorial gallery with one-click\n76\t  launch of a tutorial into the user's project (workbench with notebook, or\n77\t  imported pipeline)\n78\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b46dd6bfafb29f3c","agent_id":"a44a4cee62a9037ef","session_id":"8fde49e5-4b3d-4b7f-9888-7a2f9f5128eb","uuid":"57e8ee78-1923-42e5-acc9-4b32657222c7","timestamp":"2026-10-26T16:33:29.008Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9350bdd5cd791073","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review revised decomposition"}
