duction details\n51\t- Confirm the pipeline tutorials' use of the current KFP v2 API/SDK surface\n52\t  remains compatible with the release under validation\n53\t\n54\t## Acceptance Criteria\n55\t\n56\t- Every pipeline-based tutorial in the curated set imports successfully into a\n57\t  current-release Data Science Pipelines application in a test project\n58\t- Every imported pipeline tutorial executes to completion in that project\n59\t- A validation record documents the import and execution result for each\n60\t  pipeline tutorial, and every observed defect is filed and triaged (content\n61\t  defect or platform issue)\n62\t\n63\t## HLR Traceability\n64\t\n65\t- HLR-2 (P0) — the pipeline tutorials are tested against the current release\n66\t- HLR-1 (P0) — the \"importing the pipeline\" launch path is validated on the\n67\t  Data Science Pipelines surface\n68\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b46dd6bfafb29f3c","agent_id":"a44a4cee62a9037ef","session_id":"8fde49e5-4b3d-4b7f-9888-7a2f9f5128eb","uuid":"f3d63f2b-7aa0-4032-8eb1-d4f0e251e326","timestamp":"2026-10-26T16:33:29.753Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-96df83e574d6be3c","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review revised decomposition"}
